    "id": 4901011020290,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん……甘奈、甜花ちゃんのためなら\r\nなんだってしてあげたいって思ってるの",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020300,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも……最近の甜花ちゃんはなんだか……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "うん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020310,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "元気がないっていうとちょっと違うんだけど……\r\nなんか変な感じがするんだ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020310"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020320,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "本当になんとなくなんだけど\r\n一緒にいるといつもと違うなって感じがするの……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\nもう少し詳しく教えてくれるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020330,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん……上手く説明できないんだけど……\r\n甜花ちゃんらしくないっていうか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020330"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020340,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でもでも、本当なの……！\r\n甜花ちゃん、いつもと何かが違ってて……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020340"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "（甘奈さんの説明は要領を得ないが……\r\n表情から真剣なことは伝わってくる）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "（信じてあげたいんだが……\r\n甜花さんのことはよく知らないし……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020350,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、そうだ……！　甜花ちゃんが変わった\r\nきっかけ、ちょっと心当たりがあって",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "ん、心当たり？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020360,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん。甜花ちゃん、\r\n授業中に居眠りしちゃうことがよくあるんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020360"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "主人公",
    "text": "（居眠りばかり……\r\n不良な生徒なのか……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0023"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020370,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "反省しなさいって、懺悔室に連れてかれたことがあったの\r\nその時から変わっちゃったような気がして……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020370"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020380,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あの部屋、きっと何かあるんじゃないかな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "0022",
    "voice": "special_communications/490101102/4901011020380"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901011020390,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "校内新聞でも、怪しい何かを見たって\r\n記事があったし……",
